{"clock":7,"ops":[{"kind":"link","author":"ee004d31386b76440a74651c79871f156633d4ff","time":1793004401,"data":{"issue":"057c7e11281d1969f0a5fe833315fab41455db37","forge_id":"5958465403","number":"36","url":"https://github.com/guilbep/git-board/issues/36"}},{"kind":"seen","author":"ee004d31386b76440a74651c79871f156633d4ff","time":1793004401,"data":{"issue":"057c7e11281d1969f0a5fe833315fab41455db37","field":"title","value":"co2: check what filters on the bug/feat labels before kind-types"}},{"kind":"seen","author":"ee004d31386b76440a74651c79871f156633d4ff","time":1793004401,"data":{"issue":"057c7e11281d1969f0a5fe833315fab41455db37","field":"body","value":"Raised by the amended ADR 0001 (issue-metadata-map, 2026-10-21). With native-fields, a kind held as the GitHub Issue Type is no longer a label on GitHub. Once co2's bridges set `kind-types = bug=Bug,feat=Feature`, the flat `bug` and `feat` labels come off every co2 issue that holds the type. Anything that filters on those labels would then silently stop matching: Project 40's automations, saved searches, the issue templates' auto-labels, and people's bookmarks.\n\nBefore any co2 sync sets `kind-types`:\n- [ ] List what filters on `bug`/`feat` in co2, read only: Project 40's workflows and views, the repository's workflows, saved searches. Never write to co2 or Project 40.\n- [ ] Then decide:\n  - (a) move those filters to `type:Bug`/`type:Feature`. GitHub Projects can filter and group on the Issue Type, since `ProjectV2FieldType` has `ISSUE_TYPE`.\n  - (b) a third mode in the fork, e.g. `kinds = both`, that keeps the label beside the type. That is ADR 0001's original rule, and it needs design: which side wins when they disagree.\n  - (c) leave co2 without `kind-types`. Its kinds then stay flat labels, and types come in as `kind:bug` and so on beside them.\n"}},{"kind":"seen","author":"ee004d31386b76440a74651c79871f156633d4ff","time":1793004401,"data":{"issue":"057c7e11281d1969f0a5fe833315fab41455db37","field":"status","value":"open"}},{"kind":"seen","author":"ee004d31386b76440a74651c79871f156633d4ff","time":1793004401,"data":{"issue":"057c7e11281d1969f0a5fe833315fab41455db37","field":"labels","value":"kind:chore\nprio:p1\nstatus:backlog"}},{"kind":"seen","author":"ee004d31386b76440a74651c79871f156633d4ff","time":1793004401,"data":{"issue":"057c7e11281d1969f0a5fe833315fab41455db37","field":"assignees","value":"161889"}}]}